                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>It shall be the duty of every parent or guardian to admit or cause to be admitted his or her child or ward, as the case may be, to an elementary education in the neighbourhood school.<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
